==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|resource|ful|pos=adjective}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[capable|Capable]] or [[clever]]; able to put available [[resource]]s to [[efficient]] or [[ingenious]] use; using materials [[at hand]] wisely or efficiently.
#: ''With a '''resourceful''' use of space and a fresh coat of paint, the room became a pleasant library with a comfortable seating area.''

